    "expert_name": "Lead Architect John",
    "expert_answer": "Solana is not natively supported by Brilliant Directories. To accept SOL, you must use our Webhook Service (Developer Hub > API Services) to ping a custom middleware like Helio or Solana Pay, then credit the member profile via REST API PUT /members/{id}.",
